Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.75,0:02:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第4集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想让我们继承他的遗志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad wants us to pick up where he left off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.25,0:00:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,救助他人 猎杀恶魔 家族事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}saving people, hunting things, the family business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 今天是你的幸运日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today's your lucky day, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.01,0:00:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能帮我看着萨姆吧？- 老爸 我会的 你知道我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You watch out for Sammy, okay? - Dad, you know I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.97,0:00:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.47,0:00:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡时间 上午10：41{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time of death, 10:41 a.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想父亲 我现在感觉很差{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss him, man. And I'm not all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你感觉也不会好 - 我已经接受父亲已死这个事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Neither are you. - I'm dealing with Dad's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲已经死了 你却太伤心接受不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's dead. It hurts so bad you can't take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.69,0:00:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 我发誓 下一次再有人问我这事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. The next person who asks me if I'm okay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就给他几拳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna start throwing punches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.83,0:00:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 现在我们有啤酒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we've got booze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.37,0:00:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧克力… 等一下 还有这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got chocolate. And…Wait for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Emo乐队的摇滚音乐 保证可以除去任何伤痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}tortured emo rock, a guaranteed cure for any broken heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要为我那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have to do all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:00:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 是的 看得出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm fine. - Yeah, I can see that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.51,0:01:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢了 Neal{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Neil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.23,0:01:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是够朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是他来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, it's probably him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.15,0:01:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.45,0:01:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪？- 冷静一下 再想想发生了什么如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is she? - Chill out. Think about this for a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要和她谈谈 - 再找个时间谈吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need to talk to her. - Some other time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.12,0:01:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get out of my face, Neil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angela?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我… 一个人… 待着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.86,0:01:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉拉 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angela, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.45,0:02:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说抱歉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sorry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.45,0:02:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说抱歉？喔 真是太好了 - 安吉拉 听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're sorry. Oh, that's great. - Angela, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听你说 我已经听够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna listen to you. I'm done listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.87,0:02:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听我说 - 你怎么能这样对我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen to me. - No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾那么爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angela?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.73,0:02:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angela?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.25,0:02:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 萨姆 算我求你了 这样做很蠢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam, I'm begging you. This is stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.09,0:02:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 去妈妈坟前拜忌？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Going to visit Mom's grave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.84,0:03:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她连坟墓都没有 在那场火烧了之后连遗体也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't have a grave. There was no body left after the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.26,0:03:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她有个石碑 - 是由我们素昧蒙面的叔叔立的碑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She has a headstone. - Yeah, put up by a man we've never met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想对着一个由陌生人立的碑 来抒发你对母亲的爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you wanna go pay your respects to a slab of granite put up by a stranger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.27,0:03:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是重点 - 那我要请教一下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not the point. - Well, then, enlighten me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.85,0:03:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是关于遗体或棺材什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about a body or a casket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.77,0:03:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们和她一起拥有的记忆 知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about her memory, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.06,0:03:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲死后 就… 就感觉这是我们应该做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after Dad, it just feels like the right thing to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这只是你的一厢情愿 - 听着 兄弟 没有人叫你一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's irrational, is what it is. - Look, man, no one asked you to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.61,0:03:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不如去路边的酒吧抓鬼呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we swing by the Roadhouse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.79,0:03:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近我们都没有那恶魔的消息了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't heard anything on the demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该把那个贱魔给做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be hunting that son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.37,0:03:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意不错 你去吧 让我在这下车 我再搭车回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good idea. You should. Just drop me off. I'll hitch a ride…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明天我们在那儿见 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I'll meet you there tomorrow. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那些人鬼混{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be stuck with those people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.95,0:03:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈些尴尬的事直到你出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}making awkward small talk until you show up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.37,0:04:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 嗯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想父亲想把这个给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Dad would have wanted you to have these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.85,0:04:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是这样 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here you go. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:06:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉拉·梅森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angela Mason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.36,0:06:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是当地的大学生 三天前刚下葬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a student at the local college. Funeral was three days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到她的坟墓了 坟周围一个圈内的所有生物都死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw her grave. Everything dead around it in a perfect circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得这有点鬼异吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think that's a little weird?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.54,0:06:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是土地主人洒了一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the groundskeeper went aggro…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀虫剂在上面 - 没有 我问过他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- with the pesticide. - No, I asked him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有杀虫剂 化学物质 没人能对此做出解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pesticide, no chemicals. Nobody can explain it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 你有什么想法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So, what are you thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 可能是污秽之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Unholy ground, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.46,0:06:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真是恶魔 想那么干是轻而易举的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If something evil happened, it could easily poison the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得希达皮兹市旁农场发生的事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the farm outside of Cedar Rapids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.39,0:06:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 这个标记可能意味着恶魔的存在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Could be the sign of a demonic presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是安吉拉这个女孩的灵魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the Angela girl's spirit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她真有这个能耐的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it's powerful enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也别那么激动 也许事情并不是你想的那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get too excited, you might pull something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想着抓鬼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just, stumbling onto a hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到哪里都是这样？- 那怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, of all places? - So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是真的只想着抓鬼 不是心里还有别的事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure this is about a hunt? Not about something else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会有什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else would it be about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:07:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道 只想忘记它 - 你要相信你想要什么 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, just forget it. - You can believe what you want, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你把我拖到这里来的 至少也要把这事查一下吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I let you drag my ass out here. Least we can do is check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这女孩的父亲在镇里工作 他是学校里的教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl's dad works in town. He's a professor at the school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 梅森博士？- 我是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dr. Mason? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.19,0:07:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是萨姆 这是迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sam. This is Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是安吉拉的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were friends of Angela's. We…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们… 我们想来慰问一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanted to offer our condolences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.33,0:07:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她真漂亮 - 是的 她很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She was beautiful. - Yes, she was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这书可不一般{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an unusual book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.22,0:08:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是古希腊书籍 我教这门课{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's Ancient Greek. I teach a course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.07,0:08:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那场车祸 这… 真是不幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a car accident, that's… That's horrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.57,0:08:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生车祸时安吉离家只有一英里远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angie was only a mile away from home when, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样失去亲人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gotta be hard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.12,0:08:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是件容易的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}losing someone like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候你会感觉她还在你的身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes it's like they're still around…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你还能感觉到她们的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}almost like you can still sense their presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.59,0:08:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有这样的感觉吗？- 事实上我有这样的感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ever feel anything like that? - I do, as a matter of fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅森博士 有这种感觉很正常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's perfectly normal, Dr. Mason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.93,0:08:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是你在经历这样的事之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially with what you're going through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我还会给她打电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I still phone her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.65,0:08:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到电话响起我才想到她已死了 嗯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the phone's ringing before I remember that, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭意味着一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family's everything, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.91,0:09:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉是我生命中最重要的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angie was the most important thing in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我失去了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, well, I'm just lost without her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're very sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.42,0:09:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有什么不对劲 只是我们还没有察觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something going on. We just haven't found it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 有可能只是一块没长草的地 没什么特别的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, so far you got a patch of dead grass and nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.47,0:09:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是有东西 让那块地变成污秽之地的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something turned that grave into unholy ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有理由可以证明 那就是块污秽之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason for it to be unholy ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉拉是车祸死的 而且她是个好女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angela Mason was a nice girl who died in a car crash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里并没有怨气存在 你听到她父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not exactly vengeful-spirit material. You heard her father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.53,0:09:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也听她父亲说了 也许她父亲并不知道她女儿的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Daddy doesn't know everything there is to know about his little angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我们不应该再打扰 那个可怜的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? We never should've bothered that poor man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都不应该在这儿 - 那你是什么意思 萨姆？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We shouldn't even be here anymore. - So, what, Sam? We just bail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们还没把事情弄清楚之前就走人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without even figuring out what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.37,0:09:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道接下来该做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know what's going on here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是我陪你到现在的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only reason I went along with you this far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么啊？- 妈妈的坟墓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about? - This is about Mom's grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:09:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got nothing to do with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在她坟墓的百码之外 没靠近过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't step within 100 yards of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你也许在捕捉 那些想像中并不存在的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, maybe you're imagining a hunt where there isn't one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.35,0:10:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你就可以不一直想着爸妈了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you don't have to think about Mom or Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还出去走走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna take another swing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.20,0:10:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去吧 如果这样做 真的会让你感觉好一点的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, if it'll make you feel better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.87,0:10:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要听这些废话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need this crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 你要去哪里？- 我要去喝一杯… 一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, where are you going? - I'm gonna go get a drink. Alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 把照相机从我的脸上拿开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, get that camera out of my face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.23,0:10:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你害羞 我 事实上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you shy? I am, as a matter of fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这会帮助你克服它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then maybe this'll help you overcome it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 骗子 你疯狂的爱着我 你知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, liar. You're crazy about me and you know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:10:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是有一个想法 我们可以做一个完全不同类型的视频{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I just had an idea. We can make a whole different kind of video.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.41,0:11:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You jerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 但我是你的傻瓜 - 请关闭相机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, but I'm your jerk. - Please turn the camera off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很美 你知道吗 你知道的 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're beautiful, you know that? You know that, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell are you? - Wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.75,0:12:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 我要报警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on. - I'm calling 911!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.75,0:12:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是安吉拉的堂兄 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Angela's cousin. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 她父亲让我来拿走她的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, her dad sent me over to, uh, pick up her stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.55,0:12:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我名字是艾伦 艾伦·斯坦威克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alan Stanwick My name's Allan. Allan Stanwick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她父亲没说有人要来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her dad didn't say that you were coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.68,0:12:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我怎么会有你这里的钥匙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how else would I have the key to your place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定看到了安吉拉的另一面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm sure you got a view of Angela that none of the family got to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 她人怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, what was she like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这个人怎么样？她很好…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was she really like? - She was great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很… 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是她很…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she was so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.01,0:13:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个关系很好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two must've been really close, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.86,0:13:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是只是她 还有马特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not just her. It's Matt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 安吉拉的男朋友呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Angela's boyfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.41,0:13:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 马特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Matt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.66,0:13:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 他怎么了？- 他昨晚自杀了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Um, what about him? - He killed himself last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:14:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自己嗐喉自杀的 这是谁做的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cut his own throat. Who does that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.67,0:14:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,太… 不幸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.46,0:14:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定不能承受安吉拉的死 我猜…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was taking Angela's death pretty hard, and I guess…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.47,0:14:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的意思是他这两天有点混乱 - 混乱什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He'd been messed up about it for days. - Messed up how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.77,0:14:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直说他到哪儿都能看见她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept saying that he saw her everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这是很正常的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sure that that's normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.94,0:14:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是有这样的经历 说这样的话是正常的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, with everything that he was going through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.73,0:14:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他看见她…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that he saw her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.11,0:14:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像游魂一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in an acid trip or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.57,0:14:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉拉和马特是不是幸福的一对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were Angela and Matt a happy couple?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.87,0:14:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说马特有做什么事 让安吉拉生气吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there any reason Angela would be angry with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.49,0:14:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 当然没有 你为什么这样问？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course not. Why do you ask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.41,0:14:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便问问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just asking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.33,0:14:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,马特住在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did Matt live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一部要播出的电影是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next on the Skin Channel:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.09,0:14:52.01,Title,0,0,0,0,,《色情房屋4》讲述了两个拉丁美女…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Casa Erotica 4: A Tale of Two Latin Beauties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.51,0:14:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.89,0:14:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,尴尬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awkward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.35,0:15:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你到底去哪了？- 在跟我想像中的案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where the hell were you? - Just working my imaginary case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.40,0:15:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？然后呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 你是对的 我没什么新发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, you were right. I didn't find much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 除了安吉拉男朋友昨晚死了… 切了自己的喉咙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Except Angela's boyfriend died last night, slit his own throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道这也很正常的 嗯 让我想想 还有什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, that's normal. Uh, let's see. What else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.24,0:15:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他死前 他说他在哪儿都能看见安吉拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he was seeing Angela everywhere before he died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 这只是我自己瞎想而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, I'm sure that's just me transferring my own feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我知道了 对不起了 那里也许真有脏东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I get it. I'm sorry. Maybe there is something going on here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.67,0:15:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是也许？萨姆 不管你怎么想 我都知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe? Sam, I know how to do my job, despite what you might think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.72,0:15:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要查一下那个人的公寓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should check out the guy's apartment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚从那儿回来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just came from there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿有一束死花 就和我们在墓地看到的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pile of dead plants, just like the cemetery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有死金鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, dead goldfish too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.31,0:15:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的是污秽之地？- 也许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So unholy ground? - Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我始终不明白 那种怨恨之气会出自于安吉拉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still not getting that powerful angry- spirit vibe from Angela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.49,0:15:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been reading this, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.79,0:16:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷了那女孩的日记？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stole the girl's diary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这女孩有点太好了 - 那你接下来想做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If anything, the girl's a little too nice. - So, what do you wanna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续调查 再和她的别的朋友谈谈 - 有他们的名字吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep digging, talk to her friends. - You get any names?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有她全世界朋友的的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have her bestest friend in the whole wide world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.35,0:16:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道大学有雇悲痛辅导员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realize the college employed grief counselors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 你说我们听就可以了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Yeah, you talk, we listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.81,0:16:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许再做一些心理治疗 来帮助你们心灵的痊愈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe throw in a therapeutic collage. Whatever helps jump start the healing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.02,0:16:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我没事 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think I'm okay. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.15,0:16:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道马特·哈里森的事了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you heard what happened to Matt Harrison, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的我知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想确认一下你没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just wanted to make sure you were okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲伤有时会让人做出疯狂的举动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grief can make people do crazy things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.29,0:16:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 对于他的事我感到很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry about what happened to him. I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果是马特自杀的话 那并不是因为悲伤而自杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if Matt killed himself, it wasn't because of grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吗？那是什么？- 是因为罪恶感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? Then why? - It was guilt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.01,0:16:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安吉是死是马特的错 - 他自己也知道 为什么是他的错？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Angie's death was Matt's fault. - How was Matt responsible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.80,0:16:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真的很爱他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She really loved that guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.35,0:17:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那天晚上的车祸是因为 她看到他和另一个女孩在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the night of the accident, she walked in on him with another girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.06,0:17:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她心都碎了 车祸就这样发生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was really torn up. That's why she crashed the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我要去工作了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, look, I gotta get ready for work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.57,0:17:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢关心 不过说真的我真的没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So thanks for the concern, but seriously, I'll be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于怨气的说法好像有点道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that vengeful- spirit theory is starting to make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是弃妇的怨气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell hath no fury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.87,0:17:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果安吉拉已经对马特报了仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if Angela got her revenge on Matt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.55,0:17:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为一切是不是结束了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you think it's over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.67,0:17:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个办法才能知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's one way to be sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.76,0:17:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.59,0:17:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么办法？- 把尸骨烧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - Burn the bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.01,0:17:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧尸骨？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn the bones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是有点晕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you high?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.81,0:17:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安吉拉上周才死 - 那又怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Angela died last week. - So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她现在还没变成骨头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not gonna be bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,棺材里还是一具完好正在腐烂的尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gonna be a ripe, rotting body in the coffin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.07,0:17:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候怕脏了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when are you afraid to get dirty, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士优先{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.56,0:18:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在4天前埋的尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They buried the body four days ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞不懂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.21,0:19:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？- 我不敢肯定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.97,0:19:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但之前我见过这些符号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen these kinds of symbols before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 别激动 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, take it easy. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.57,0:19:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是安吉拉的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Angie's friends, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:19:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 梅森博士… - 我们得谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dr. Mason…We need to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.57,0:20:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 进来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.11,0:20:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是教古希腊语的 告诉我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You teach Ancient Greek. Tell me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what are these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和安吉拉有关吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said this had something to do with Angela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 拜托 回答我的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does. Please, just humor me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.85,0:20:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是古希腊占卜仪式的一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're part of an Ancient Greek divination ritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.85,0:20:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是做来施巫术的 对吧？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Used for necromancy, right? - That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.02,0:20:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧 在来这之前 我们去过图书馆 自己做过一些调查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we came here, we stopped by the library and did a little homework.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.73,0:20:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 他们是用这个来与死者沟通的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, they use rituals like this one for communicating with the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至可以让尸体复活 根本就是还魂术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even bringing corpses back to life, full- on zombie action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.78,0:20:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.62,0:20:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 在传说中是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, according to the legends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但这又有什么关系？- 你自己清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, what's all this about? - I think you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 我明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Look, I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:20:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会想方设法地想再见某些人一面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? There are people that I would give anything to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是你有什么特权？- 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But what gives you the right? - Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.84,0:21:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么？- 该死的就不应该活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What's dead should stay dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.01,0:21:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你召回来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What you brought back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.55,0:21:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你女儿 那些东西是邪恶的 残暴的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't even your daughter. These things are vicious. They're violent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.30,0:21:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们肮脏之极 可以让周围的一切东西都腐烂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're so nasty, they rot the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.31,0:21:13.52,Title,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 难道你没看过《宠物坟场》吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on, haven't you seen Pet Sematary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.98,0:21:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪？- 滚出我的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is she? - Get out of my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你把她藏起来了 她在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're hiding her somewhere. Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.23,0:21:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 住嘴吧 够了 迪恩 快看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, stop. That's enough. Dean, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.57,0:21:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的植物还是鲜活的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful, living plants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.53,0:21:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走了 - 我要报警了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're leaving. - I'm calling the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.62,0:21:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很抱歉 先生 我们不会再来烦你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we're sorry. We won't bother you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.71,0:21:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你到底是怎么了？- 离我远点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is the matter with you? - Back off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.75,0:21:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人是无辜的 你不该那样对他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man is innocent. He didn't deserve that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来她不在这里 也许他藏在别的地方了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's keeping her somewhere else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.13,0:21:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了 够了 好吗？够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it. That's enough, okay? Enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 我知道自己在干什么 - 不 你不知道… 一点都不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, I know what I'm doing. - No, you don't. At all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.18,0:21:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没那么容易被吓 但你这样吓坏我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I don't scare easy, but you're scaring the crap out of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.43,0:21:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别想的那么戏剧化 - 萨姆 你很庆幸我们有事做了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't be dramatic san. - You're lucky this turned out to be a case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使这不是 你也会找其它东西来猎杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if it wasn't, you would've found something else to kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.73,0:22:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的情绪现在很激动 很不稳定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on edge. You're erratic. Except for when you're hunting…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.69,0:22:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有在抓鬼的时候 你才能真正宣泄你的情绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because then you're downright scary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.33,0:22:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正在失去控制 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're tailspinning, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.28,0:22:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你避而不谈 也不让我来帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you refuse to talk about it, and you won't let me help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.86,0:22:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能照顾自己 谢谢了 - 不 你不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can take care of myself, thanks. - No, you can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.16,0:22:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不行 是你自己在给自己背上这个重担{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You're the only one who thinks you should have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.49,0:22:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必独自挡起这事 没人可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to handle this on your own. No one can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.16,0:22:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你再敢提起老爸的死…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you bring up Dad's death one more time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.87,0:22:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 迪恩 它在折磨你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. Please. Dean, it's killing you. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.05,0:22:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经失去老爸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've already lost Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.76,0:22:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去了妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.59,0:22:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也失去了杰西卡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost Jessica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.64,0:22:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道现在我要失去你了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I'm gonna lose you too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.22,0:22:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好在警察到之前 离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We better get out of here before the cops come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.44,0:22:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了 我很混球 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you. Okay? Yeah, I'm being an ass. And I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.44,0:22:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有个变态的活死人在附近转悠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we got a zombie running around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.58,0:22:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须得找出杀死它的方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to figure out how to kill it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.11,0:22:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.87,0:22:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我们的生活真够古怪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our lives are weird, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:22:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:23:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.08,0:23:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 有事在困扰你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, is something bothering you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是马特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about Matt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.88,0:23:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不是已经讲好的吗？- 我知道 但是 呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Haven't we talked about that? - I know, but-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.51,0:23:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是不是 在他身上浪费太多时间了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't we wasted enough time on him already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.93,0:23:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是说他配不上我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always said that he didn't deserve me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.07,0:23:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说对了 - 安吉拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were right. - Angela…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.08,0:23:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是去见过马特 或…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you didn't get out and go see Matt, or…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.79,0:23:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直呆在这里啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been here the whole time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.67,0:23:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的认为我会做出那种事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neal… Neil, you really think I could do something like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.00,0:23:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.21,0:23:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 总会不由自主地那么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I can't help it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.76,0:23:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是你… 你看起来… - 不同了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You just You seem - Different?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.35,0:23:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的 我是不同了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.98,0:24:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经明白了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've realized…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.69,0:24:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是那唯一爱我的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're the only one who ever really loved me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.19,0:24:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经证明过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You proved that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.36,0:24:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你复活了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought me back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.78,0:24:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我和你在一起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.16,0:24:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你一直想要的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that what you always wanted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.58,0:24:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道就不能给她脑门一枪吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just waste it with a headshot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.71,0:24:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你想得也太简单了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you've been watching way too many Romero flicks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.71,0:24:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 没有可以杀死活死人的办法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's no lore on how to smoke them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.93,0:24:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我是说方法太多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean, I'm telling you there's too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.22,0:24:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有上百种关于活死人的传说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a hundred legends on the walking dead…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.34,0:24:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死它们的方法也有上百种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they all have different methods for killing them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.02,0:24:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的说用火烧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some say setting them on fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.64,0:24:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有的说… 在哪呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One said… Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.56,0:24:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿 把它们的心脏拿去喂野狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here. feeding their hearts to wild dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.73,0:24:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我最喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my personal favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.40,0:24:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是谁知道其中的真伪啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows what's real and what's myth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.36,0:24:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有共同点吗？- 没有 只是有些说道银器可能管用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there anything they have in common? - No. A few said silver might work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.19,0:24:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就先用银器吧 - 但是现在怎样才能找到安吉拉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Silver's a start. - Yeah. But how are we gonna find Angela?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.49,0:24:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就得先找出是谁让她复活的 - 有线索吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta figure out who brought her back. - Any ideas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.62,0:25:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是她爸爸的话 那就可能是那个叫尼尔的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think if it's not her dad, it might be that guy Neil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.70,0:25:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼尔 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Neal? - Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.21,0:25:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道的？- 你有张良计 我有过墙梯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd you come up with that? - Well, you got your journal, I got mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.08,0:25:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,「尼尔是个可以依靠的肩膀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Neil's a real shoulder to cry on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.04,0:25:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很了解我和马特之间的事「{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He so understands what I'm going through with Matt."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.42,0:25:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还有很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more in here where that came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.14,0:25:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处写满了这种无私奉献的爱意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got unrequited Duckie love all over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.59,0:25:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那不代表就是他做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that doesn't mean he brought her back from the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.43,0:25:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我有提过 他是梅森教授的助教吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. Did I mention that he's Professor Mason's TA?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.81,0:25:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以拿到一样的书籍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has access to all the same books?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.77,0:25:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.11,0:25:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.70,0:25:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的悲痛辅导员来了 我们是来安慰你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your grief counselors. We've come to hug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.16,0:25:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,银弹？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver bullets?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.66,0:25:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 足以打得她像个零钱包了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, enough to make her rattle like a change purse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.03,0:26:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非这是他藏A片的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless this is where he keeps his porn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.39,0:26:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看这里像个活死人的猪圈 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure looks like a zombie pen to me. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.60,0:26:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是空的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An empty one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.06,0:26:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为安吉拉是去找什么人了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Angela's going after somebody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.49,0:27:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我想她是出去租电影了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think she went out to rent Beaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.70,0:27:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 聪明人 她也许去杀人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, smart-ass, she might kill someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.71,0:27:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到她 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta find her, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.50,0:27:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.30,0:27:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 她杀了马特 因为他欺骗了她 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, she clipped Matt because he was cheating, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.51,0:27:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 要偷情的话 你知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Well, it takes two to, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.47,0:27:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,都要成对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have hardcore sex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.76,0:27:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我只是觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, it just seemed that Angela's roommate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.48,0:27:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对马特的死很伤心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was broken up over Matt's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.90,0:27:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指 打心底的那种伤心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, like, really broken up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.21,0:27:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.84,0:28:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 琳赛 我回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Lindsey. I'm home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.40,0:28:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚自己做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.86,0:28:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 真的对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I am so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.95,0:28:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还不够{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not sorry enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.31,0:28:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.85,0:28:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.02,0:28:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的上帝啊 哦 我的上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.68,0:29:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I got you. I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.60,0:29:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 那个死小妞跑得真快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, that dead chick can run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.98,0:29:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.69,0:29:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,该去找尼尔聊聊了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we go have a little chat with Neil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.03,0:29:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 那些银弹 有些作用吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the silver bullets, they did something, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.70,0:29:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 有些作用 但还不够 你还查到什么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, something. But not enough. What else you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.28,0:29:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.53,0:29:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了银器 我们还要 「把活死人顶在它们的棺材里」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, besides silver, we have nailing the undead back into their grave beds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.46,0:29:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个被提到好几次了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mentioned a few times{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.75,0:29:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这就是钉吸血鬼的由来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably where the vampire staking lore came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.71,0:30:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们的棺材？你认真的吗？- 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Their grave beds? You serious? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.05,0:30:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要怎样 才能把安吉拉引到公墓啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell are we gonna get Angela back to the cemetery?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.73,0:30:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来这做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.23,0:30:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过有人为了放倒女孩 而不择手段{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard of some people doing some desperate things to get laid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.85,0:30:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.07,0:30:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却放倒一具尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take the cake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.28,0:30:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, who are you guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.91,0:30:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许该去问问安吉拉这个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might wanna ask Angela that question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.66,0:30:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我们知道你做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - We know what you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.37,0:30:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,仪式…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.16,0:30:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.79,0:30:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.54,0:30:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的女朋友是个死人 说我们疯了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your girlfriend's past her expiration date and we're crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.00,0:30:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当人们死时 他们就得是死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When someone's gone, they should stay gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.80,0:30:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能把那事给弄混了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't mess with that kind of stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.68,0:30:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉拉杀了马特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angela killed Matt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.05,0:30:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想要杀死琳赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tried to kill Lindsey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.89,0:30:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你们在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.52,0:31:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 别废话了 尼尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. No more crap, Neil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.31,0:31:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手上已经沾满了血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His blood is on your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.48,0:31:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和他可以平息这事 但你告诉我们她在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, me and him can make this right, but you gotta tell us where she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.57,0:31:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.33,0:31:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我家 她在我家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My house. She's at my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.46,0:31:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.52,0:31:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 她在哪其实并不重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, it doesn't really matter where she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.90,0:31:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个办法可以阻止她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way to stop her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.48,0:31:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就在她的墓地再做次仪式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've gotta perform another ritual over her grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.11,0:31:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,从而颠倒你所做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To reverse the one that you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.70,0:31:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一些黑根 瘢痕叶和一些蜡烛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need some black root, some scar weed, some candles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.03,0:31:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常复杂 但是那会让这一切结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated, but it'll get the job done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.32,0:31:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时后她又会死去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be dead again in a couple hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.54,0:32:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你应该和我们一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you should come with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.13,0:32:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说真的 尼尔 马上就跟我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious, Neil. Leave with us, right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.84,0:32:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.22,0:32:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.85,0:32:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.14,0:32:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽快离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here as soon as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.39,0:32:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是最重要的是要冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But most of all, be cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.73,0:32:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要惊慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sudden movements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.52,0:32:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要惹她生气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make her mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.20,0:32:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.38,0:32:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说过你不会出去的 - 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said you'd stay in the house. - I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.63,0:32:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想见见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just needed to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.76,0:32:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔 求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neil, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.39,0:33:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得帮帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.06,0:33:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.69,0:33:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我一起去公墓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me to the cemetery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.44,0:33:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔 他们想要杀了我 我们得去阻止他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neil, they're trying to kill me. We have to stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.53,0:33:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说要杀了他们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.12,0:33:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是真的喽…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.12,0:33:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马特和琳赛 - 他们先伤害我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Matt and Lindsey. - They hurt me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.83,0:33:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你爱我 你就不能让别人再次伤害我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you love me, you'll make sure nobody hurts me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.92,0:33:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去公墓 然后等一切都结束后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me to the cemetery, and then all this will be over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.46,0:33:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能一起开始新的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can start new lives together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.51,0:33:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.01,0:33:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿上帝助我 但是好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God help me, but okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.22,0:33:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go get the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.73,0:33:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就… 就等在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… Just wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.50,0:34:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔 你看起来很紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neil, you look nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.05,0:34:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.38,0:34:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你… 想要抛弃我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you going to leave me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.80,0:34:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 当然不会 - 你会的 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, of course not. I…You were, weren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.10,0:34:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.98,0:34:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼尔 我爱你啊 - 安吉拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Neil, I loved you. - Angela{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.99,0:34:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真认为这可行吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think this is gonna work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.87,0:34:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不一定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.21,0:34:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这我唯一能想到的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was the only thing I could come up with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.39,0:35:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这不是你所想的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. It's not what you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.39,0:35:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有想过要复活 但我还是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask to be brought back. But it's still me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.94,0:35:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍是个人 求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still a person. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.81,0:36:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.41,0:36:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的就不应该活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's dead should stay dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.13,0:37:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安息吧 - 是的 这次一定要了 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rest in peace. - Yeah. For good this time, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.14,0:37:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 这整个引诱安吉拉来公墓的假仪式计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the whole fake- ritual thing, luring Angela into the cemetery…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.65,0:37:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很高明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretty sharp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.07,0:37:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.82,0:37:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你一定要把我当成诱饵了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But did we have to use me as bait?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.49,0:37:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你更合她的胃口 她喜欢那种吊儿郎当的帅哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured you were more her type. She had pretty crappy taste in guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.62,0:37:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她弄断了我的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she broke my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.29,0:37:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是太脆弱了 我们待会去料理你的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just too fragile. We'll get it looked at later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.00,0:37:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要多待一会吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna stay for a while?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.97,0:37:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.33,0:38:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.54,0:39:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.63,0:39:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.26,0:39:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了最近我所做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I've been acting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.74,0:39:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有老爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.58,0:39:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 他也是你的老爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he was your dad too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.25,0:39:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的死是我的错 - 你在说什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And it's my fault that he's gone. - What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.17,0:39:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你已经想到了 我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you've been thinking it. So have I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.96,0:39:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那并不难想到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't take a genius to figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.67,0:39:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在医院的时候 我的伤一下子全好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back at the hospital, you know, full recovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.18,0:39:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个奇迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a miracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.89,0:39:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是5分钟后 老爸死了 柯尔特也不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And five minutes later, Dad's dead and the CoIt's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.64,0:40:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要告诉我这之间没有关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't tell me there's not a connection there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.98,0:40:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道那个恶魔是怎么得逞的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how the demon was involved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.61,0:40:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不知道到底是发生了什么事…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how the whole thing went down, exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.57,0:40:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是老爸是因我而死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Dad's dead because of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.24,0:40:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这我很清楚 - 我们都不肯定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that much I do know. - We don't know that. Not for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.29,0:40:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.42,0:40:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和老爸…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and Dad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.67,0:40:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是我一生中最重要的亲人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're the most important people in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.13,0:40:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.18,0:40:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我后悔自己被救了回来 萨姆 那样是违反常规的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never should've come back, Sam. It wasn't natural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.23,0:40:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now look what's come of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.36,0:40:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本该死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.82,0:40:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不应该活着的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I should have stayed dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.87,0:41:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要知道我的感受吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to know how I was feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.46,0:41:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.67,0:41:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.39,0:41:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么说才能纠正这一切？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what could you possibly say to make that all right?{\r}
